# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Minimization in a Python simulation on the CPU (D202), scenario mixed of
# Inputs/python_minimize.py.
# The minimizer of `mdir run` in mixed precision, in several parts, against
# its last row and checkpoint, and the NVT stage after it. The bounds take
# `mdir run` in double precision, computed again here without being checked
# (scenario double compares the model with it).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_minimize.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir %t mixed | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: CPU Mixed: one part of 100 steps:
# CHECK: CPU Mixed: 10 parts of one step after it: row at step 110 within
# CHECK: CPU Mixed: 30 parts of one step: row at step 30 within
# CHECK: CPU Mixed: NVT from the minimized state, step 10:
# CHECK: minimization mixed passed
